---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms · Nrvana AI">
  <section class="section pt-20 pb-20 max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold">Terms</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm" style="color: var(--color-ink-mute);">Effective June 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8" style="color: var(--color-ink-soft);">

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">How engagements work</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Every project starts with a written scope: what we will do, what it costs, and when it will be done. Nothing is binding until both parties have agreed to that scope in writing. This website is informational; it does not constitute a contract or a binding offer.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Payment</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Fixed-fee projects are invoiced in two parts: 50% before we start, 50% on delivery. Retainers are billed monthly, in advance. We accept bank transfer and major card payments. All fees are stated in USD.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">If a project is cancelled after work has begun, the deposit is non-refundable. If we cancel, we will refund any portion of the deposit not yet earned.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">What you own</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Everything we build for you is yours. On final payment, full ownership of all deliverables transfers to you: workflows, prompts, context files, templates, and any other work product. We retain no ongoing rights or licenses.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">We may reference the existence of an engagement (without disclosing your identity or work) as a general description of our services, unless you ask us not to.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Confidentiality</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We treat everything you share with us as confidential. We do not discuss client work with third parties, use your information for other purposes, or disclose details of your business without your consent. We expect you to treat our processes and proprietary methods similarly.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Results and liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We do our best work on every project and stand behind the quality of what we deliver. We cannot guarantee specific business outcomes from AI adoption. Our liability for any claim arising from a project is limited to the fees paid for that project.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">AI tools are third-party services with their own terms and limitations. We configure them; we do not control them. We are not responsible for changes to third-party tools after delivery.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Governing law</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas, United States. Any disputes will be resolved in good faith between the parties before any formal proceeding.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">If anything here is unclear, just ask. <a href="mailto:hi@nrvana.com" class="underline underline-offset-4">hi@nrvana.com</a>. We answer personally.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
